android/gradle/wrapper/, android/gradlew, android/gradlew.bat
  The Gradle wrapper, Apache-2.0.

scripts/enter-fastboot.py
  A Python version of the "Enter Fastboot Mode" button of rabbit's official web
  flash tool (https://rabbit-hmi-oss.github.io/flashing/). The mechanism, writing
  "FASTBOOT" to the MediaTek preloader's serial port, is taken from that tool's
  js/fastboot-ops.js.

Not included: Power Grotesk, by Power Type Foundry. The app, the installer and the
tools load the owner's own copy, downloaded by the owner.

Not included: mtkclient (https://github.com/bkerler/mtkclient), by Bjoern Kerler and
contributors, GPL-3.0. The installer downloads it at a pinned commit into its own
environment in the user's cache, with libusb (LGPL-2.1) from PyPI's libusb-package, and
runs it as a separate program to read the R1's stock boot image over the preloader.
